{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31601","headline":"同郑相幷歌姬小饮戏赠 · 李羣玉","name":"同郑相幷歌姬小饮戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"裙拖六幅湘江水，鬓耸巫山一段云。\n风格只应天上有，歌声岂合世间闻。\n胸前瑞雪灯斜照，眼底桃花酒半醺。\n不是相如怜赋客，争敎容易见文君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}